<title>NEW ZEALAND: Leeming changes name to Pacific Retail.</title>
<headline>Leeming changes name to Pacific Retail.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noel Leeming Limited said on Friday it would change its name to Pacific Retail Group Limited, effective September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>New share script would be issued to shareholders under the new name and forwarded to them on October 4. To that end, the share register would close on September 27 and reopen on September 30.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
